  "The key %s opens MoveAnything! now.": "%s 키로 MoveAnything!을 엽니다.",
  "Type /move to open or close the window. Type /move FrameName to move a frame by its name. Type /move pick to pick a frame on the screen. Type /move hide FrameName to hide or show a frame. Type /move done to stop moving all frames. Type /unmove FrameName to put a frame back where the game puts it. Type /move key <key> to set a key for the window. Type /movelist to see the saved layouts, /movecopy Name to copy one and /movedelete Name to delete one.": "명령어: /move (창), /move FrameName (이동), /move pick (선택), /move hide FrameName (표시 전환), /move done (완료), /unmove FrameName (초기화), /move key <key> (단축키), /movelist (목록), /movecopy Name (복사), /movedelete Name (삭제).",
  "Type /movecopy Name. /movelist shows the names.": "/movecopy Name을 사용하세요. 이름 목록: /movelist.",
